        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nyumba siŵili syakuŵandikana ni Nyumba ja AMBUJE",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Panyuma pakwe mundu jula ŵanjigalile une kusa kwa luŵala ni kulongolela m'nyumba ca kumpoto kwa Nyumba ja AMBUJE, jele janganijiŵa pakutalikangana ni Nyumba ja AMBUJE jijaliji kungapilo lyuŵa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyumba jeleji jaliji mamita makumi msano mcilewu mwakwe ni mamita makumi gaŵili ni msano mcijipi mwakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Upande wine walolegene ni luŵala lwa mamita likumi mcijipi lwele lwaliji mumbali mwa Nyumba ja AMBUJE, nipo mbali jine lwalolegene ni mpata wakupita ku luŵala lwa kusa. Jataŵidwe m'mapenu gatatu gakusajikana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kumpoto kwa nyumbaji kwapali mpata wa mamita msano mcijipi mwakwe ni mamita makumi msano mcilewu mwakwe, kwele kuli yipata yakwe yakwinjilila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yipinda yapenani yaliji yamwana kulekangana ni yasikati ni yapasi ligongo yaliji kwakutalicila mnope. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yipinda ya lipenu lyatatu yaliji yangali njalamila mpela luŵala lwakwete njalamila; myoyo yaliji yamalo gamwana kulekangana ni yapasi ni yasikati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lipenu lyapasi, lipupa lyakwe lyakusa kwa nyumba jeleji lyaliji lyakandapala mamita makumi gaŵili ni msano, hafu ja cilewu cakwe; nipo mwaliji yipinda mamita makumi gaŵili ni msano gakusigalago. Nipo lipenu lyakwinani lyaliji ni yipinda mcilewu cosope ca nyumbajo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.7+EZK.42.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.7",
              "EZK.42.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pasi pa yipinda yiŵiliyi kumbesi kwa kungopoko lyuŵa kwa nyumbajo, kwele mapupa ga luŵala lwakusa gatandile, kwana yipata yakwinjilila luŵala lwakusalo. Upande wa mbali ja kum'mwela kwa Nyumba ja AMBUJEJO kwapali nyumba syakulandana syele syanganisiŵa pakutalicila ni nyumba jaliji ku ngapilo lyuŵa kwa Nyumba ja AMBUJE. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.9+EZK.42.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.9",
              "EZK.42.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kusogolo kwakwe kwa yipindayo kwapali mpata mpela wele waliji upande wa kumpoto. Mpata wakwe wakwete mlingo wakulandana, kataŵe kakwe kakulandana, ni yipata yakwinjila soni yakulandana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nipo kusi kwa yipinda ya kum'mwela kwa nyumbajo, kwapali mlango wakwinjila, kungopoko lyuŵa kwele kulyatandilile lipupa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sambano mundu jula ŵasalile kuti, “Yipinda yakumpoto ni kum'mwela yakulolegana ni luŵala lwa Nyumba ja AMBUJE yili yeswela. Mwelemo ŵakutaga mbopesi uŵakutama ciŵandika ni AMBUJE ŵalilagamo mbopesi syapajika mnope. Mwelemo taciŵika mbopesisi pampepe ni mbopesi sya yakulidwa, mbopesi syakupecesya ulemwa,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ni mbopesi syakuti yindu yiŵe cenene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndaŵi jele ŵakutaga mbopesi ali m'nyumba ja AMBUJE nipo akusaka kwawula ku luŵala lwa kusa, akwenela kuyileka yakuwala myipindamo yele yiŵawete pamtumicileje AMBUJE. Ni kuwala yakuwala yine wamba mkinajawule ku malo kwele kwasongene ŵandu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mipimo ja luŵala lwa Nyumba ja AMBUJE",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndaŵi jele mundu jula ŵamalisisye kulinga mkati mwa Nyumba ja AMBUJE, mundu jula jwanjigalile kusa kupitila ku cipata ca kungopoko lyuŵa nipo soni ŵalinjile luŵala losope lwa kusa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵajigele simbo jakulinjila jila ni ŵalinjile upande wa kungopoko lyuŵa, nipo wulewu wakwe waliji mamita 250. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaneko ŵalinjile upande wa mbali ja kumpoto, wa mbali ja kum'mwela, nipo soni wa mbali ja kungapililo lyuŵa; upande uliwose waliji wulewu wakwe umpepe wa mamita 250, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.17+EZK.42.18+EZK.42.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.17",
              "EZK.42.18",
              "EZK.42.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "myoyo mapupa gosope mcece gasyungulile luŵala galiji mamita 250 lipupa lililyose. Lipupalyo lyakamulaga masengo gakulekanganya yindu yeswela ni yangaŵa yeswela.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
